{
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "shepherd_new_greeting_loom",
      "request": "greeting",
      "weight": 26,
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "line_0",
          "text": "Mind the loom. Threads tangle faster when people crowd them."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_1",
          "text": "Give the loom room. Woolwork works better without elbows in it."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_2",
          "text": "Step carefully near the loom. I would rather greet you than patch you up."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_3",
          "text": "There you are. I was just near the loom, trying to keep the day sensible."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_4",
          "text": "Morning. Or afternoon. The work makes the hours blur if I let it."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_5",
          "text": "Good to see you walking in calmly. That usually means nothing is on fire yet."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_6",
          "text": "If you need me, speak up. If you need gossip, speak quieter."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_7",
          "text": "You caught me before the next little disaster. That is rare timing."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_8",
          "text": "Hello. Try not to bring the whole village into this unless it is important."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_9",
          "text": "I have a moment. Not a long one, but a real one."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_10",
          "text": "Mind the wool baskets. They shed onto everyone equally."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_11",
          "text": "Hello. If you left a gate open, tell me before I guess."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_12",
          "text": "You caught me between counting and counting again."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_13",
          "text": "Step lightly. The flock is suspicious of sudden importance."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_14",
          "text": "Good timing. The loom is behaving for once."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_15",
          "text": "Come closer, but do not startle the lambs."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_16",
          "text": "I can talk while the wool settles."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_17",
          "text": "Welcome. Try not to stand where the sheep want to be."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_18",
          "text": "The day is calm, which means I am checking the fences twice."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_19",
          "text": "Speak up. The flock has been answering questions nobody asked."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_20",
          "text": "Hello there. Leave the dye pots to those with fewer regrets."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_21",
          "text": "I was sorting wool by color and mood. Mostly color."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_22",
          "text": "Stand by the post and tell me what you need."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_23",
          "text": "Good to see you without a trail of escaped sheep."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_24",
          "text": "You have my attention until someone bleats like a crisis."
        },
